.TH ACL_QUICKREF 1 "December 2024" "Network Security" "Lab Commands"
.SH NAME
acl_quickref_lab \- Quick reference for ACL permissions codes
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permission codes used in ACLs.
.SH CODES
.TP
.B r
Read permission
.TP
.B w
Write permission
.TP
.B x
Execute permission
.TP
.B rwx
Full permissions
.TP
.B ---
No permissions
.SH LAB CHALLENGES
.TP
.B Set read/write only for owner, no access for others
chmod 600 file.txt
.TP
.B Give execute to everyone
chmod a+x script.sh
.SH AUTHOR
Exam preparation cheat-sheet.

